// Converted 1:1 from apps/web/src/app/workbench/useGoalRuntime.ts (CXU plugins @ f2cb649d). Bulk conversion pass — defects logged, not yet fixed.
// Aggregator hook (goal/workspace layer): consumes the access / taskTabs /
// threadWorkspace / selection runtimes, creates the socket client, wires the
// goal lifecycle, SSH lifecycle, side chats, workspace files, terminals and
// history sub-hooks, and derives the active workspace + composer model list.
// DEFECT: React hooks semantics (useMemo/useEffect/useRef, render-time ref
// assignment) have no SLA counterpart — sub-hooks are placeholder calls in
// useGoalRuntime_init, memos become compute functions, effects become
// explicit caller-driven functions, and the returned object is the state
// struct itself.

